 \rowcolor{Color2} Product specifications &Electrode thickness, coat weight, porosity, specific capacity, binder distribution\\
\rowcolor{Color3} Process settings& Line speed, mixing time, rotational speed mixer, dryer temperatures, calendering pressure\\ 
\rowcolor{Color2} Actuator signals& R2R motor speed, coating slot width, current applied to infrared elements\\ 
\rowcolor{Color3} Process parameters &Line speed, mixing time, rotational speed mixer, dryer temperatures, calendering pressure\\ 
\rowcolor{Color2} Product parameters &Electrode thickness, coat weight, porosity, specific capacity, binder distribution
 \end{tabular}
