    \texttt{\{Good Performance Reason\}}\\

    Now, please rewrite the original message into a short, action-driven, persuasive push notification. Do not focus on personalization customization. Focus on improving clarity, structure, and incentive framing --- while preserving the original intent. Respond in the similar language style as the Original Poor Template.
  \end{tcolorbox}
  \caption{Prompt used by \texttt{TemplateAgent} to rewrite underperforming CRM messages using performance diagnostics and exemplar templates.}
  \label{fig:prompt_template_agent}
\end{figure}

\begin{figure}[h!]
