    1. Audience Match --- How well does the message suit the audience segment: \texttt{\{audience\_group\}}?\\
    2. Marketing Effectiveness --- Is the message clear, persuasive, and motivating?\\

    Use a scoring scale with three levels only: 1 = poor · 3 = average · 5 = excellent.\\

    Audience Segment: \texttt{\{audience\_group\}}\\

    Message A:\\
    \texttt{\{original\}}\\

    Message B:\\
    \texttt{\{generated\}}
  \end{tcolorbox}
