Research on the VLA4AD has moved in discernible waves, each propelled by the limitations of its predecessor and by the arrival of new cross-modal pre-training techniques. As shown in Fig. \ref{fig3}, in what follows, we trace four successive stages: \emph{Explanatory Language Models}, \emph{Modular VLA4AD}, \emph{End-to-end VLA4AD}, and \emph{Reasoning-centric VLA4AD}. 

