In an analogous fashion, from (\ref{eq:liftgenAanal19c}) we find
\begin{eqnarray}\label{eq:liftgenAanal19h}
\sum_{i_1=1}^{l}\sum_{i_2=1}^{l}\sum_{j=1}^{m} \lp
\sum_{i_3=1}^{l} \frac{
\lp \mE_{{\mathcal U}_1} Z_{i_3}^{\m_1} \rp^{p-1}    }{ \lp
\sum_{i_3=1}^{l}
\lp \mE_{{\mathcal U}_1} Z_{i_3}^{\m_1} \rp^p \rp   }
\frac{\beta_{i_1}\Theta_2}{\sqrt{1-t}}\rp
 \hspace{-.07in}
 & = &  \hspace{-.05in} -s(1-\m_1) \mE_{G,{\mathcal U}_2} \Bigg( \Bigg.
 \sum_{i_3=1}^{l} \frac{
\lp \mE_{{\mathcal U}_1} Z_{i_3}^{\m_1} \rp^{p}    }{ \lp
\sum_{i_3=1}^{l}
\lp \mE_{{\mathcal U}_1} Z_{i_3}^{\m_1} \rp^p \rp   }
\nonumber \\
