To find $T_{G,j}^{d_{k_1-1}}$ we first note
 \begin{eqnarray}\label{eq:rthlev2genanal35}
T_{G,j}^{d_{k_1-1}} & = &  \beta^2 \mE_{G,{\mathcal U}_{r+1},{{\mathcal U}_{r}},\dots,{{\mathcal U}_{1}}} \Bigg(\Bigg.
 \sum_{p_1=1}^{l} (\x^{(p_1)})^T\x^{(i_1)} \lp  \beta_{i_1}\beta_{p_1} \rp^{-1}
\prod_{v=r+1,v\neq k_1}^{2} \zeta_{v-1}^{\frac{\m_v}{\m_{v-1}}-1}
