To find $T_{G,j}^{e_{1}}$ we first write
 \begin{eqnarray}\label{eq:rthlev2genanal35bb0}
T_{G,j}^{e_{1}} & = &   \beta^2 \mE_{G,{\mathcal U}_{r+1},{{\mathcal U}_{r}},\dots,{{\mathcal U}_{1}}} \Bigg(\Bigg.
