characteristic polynomials as follows.
\begin{align*}
f = |xI - F|  &  = x^{n} - a_{1}x^{n-1} + a_{2} x^{n-2} - \cdots+ (-1)^{n}
a_{n} x^{0}\\
g = |xI - G|  &  = x^{n} - b_{1}x^{n-1} + b_{2} x^{n-2} - \cdots+ (-1)^{n}
b_{n} x^{0}.
\end{align*}
Note the alternating signs and reverse indexing from the usual indexing of
