Figure~\ref{fig:auv_response} reveals distinctly different performance characteristics across all evaluated algorithms, with significant variations in transient response and control aggressiveness. The quantitative results demonstrate the algorithms' varying degrees of adaptation to the complex hydrodynamic dynamics inherent in marine vehicle control.

